{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>陪伴大家25年的Suica企鵝將於2027年3月底正式退役，JR東日本特於上野站商場「ecute上野」舉辦告別感謝祭。現場推出多款限定美食，包括每日限量的企鵝造型冬甩與朱古力可麗露、Pensta的朱古力紅桑子鬆餅，以及加入企鵝魚板的鴨肉蕎麥麵。\n</p>\n<p>周邊方面則備有附保溫袋的飯糰套餐與紀念鐵罐甜點，於指定商戶消費還可獲贈限定企鵝杯墊或包裝紙。大家準備好飛去東京歡送企鵝未？</p>\n<p>📍地址：JR上野站3樓入閘後商場「ecute上野」（部分店舖位於公園出入口閘外2樓）<br/>\n📅日期：2026年11月18日至12月6日<br/>\n🩵留言「Suica」send限定周邊一覽給你～</p>\n<p>潮聖地圖 ｜ 為了一場盛會，絕對可以遊歷全世界！無論是花火祭、F1還是演唱會等，就是要親臨現場感受嗰份震撼！即刻DM我哋，分享你的朝聖之旅！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422562358332280_13512349626af1b5d889dbb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179422562358332280_13512349626af1b5d889dbb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfg_211k6tW/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/suica%e4%bc%81%e9%b5%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Suica企鵝</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e6%89%93%e5%8d%a1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京打卡</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e4%ba%ac%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東京旅遊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：官方圖片資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfg_211k6tW/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 9 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:23:18.168466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":487,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T12:00:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:17.646182+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:17.646182+00:00","content_hash":"dbfd8d90f54b780c6c8a7fc32e63da6b1ff19cb2a2996b9c2e71b5cf545a0215","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}